diff --git a/.github/pull_request_template.md b/.github/pull_request_template.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..347ee9b
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.github/pull_request_template.md
@@ -0,0 +1,26 @@
+## Summary
+
+Describe the change, its purpose, and the affected service(s).
+
+## Linked issue
+
+Closes #
+
+## Verification
+
+- [ ] `npm test` passes.
+- [ ] `npm run build` passes.
+- [ ] Relevant API and browser flows were exercised.
+- [ ] Tests and documentation cover changed behavior.
+
+## Secure collaboration
+
+- [ ] No secrets, credentials, real phone numbers, or personal data are included.
+- [ ] Dependencies and configuration changes are explained.
+- [ ] Service boundaries remain independent (no imports of another domain's internals).
+- [ ] Simulation-only behavior remains clearly labeled.
+- [ ] A code owner or teammate has been requested to review.
+
+## Evidence
+
+Include test results or screenshots using synthetic data only.
